INDEMNIFYING AND DEALING WITH

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.349
CORONAVIRUS LAWSUITS ARE FOR

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:57.755
BUSINESSES AND PROTECTING

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.147
