THE REPUBLICANS ADVOCATING FOR

00:01:19.688 --> 00:01:21.351
THAT SORT OF LIABILITY RELIEF

00:01:21.352 --> 00:01:23.376
FOR THE LAST YEAR WHEN THE

00:01:23.377 --> 00:01:24.695
