00:01:33.394 --> 00:01:35.006
NOW, DEMOCRATS WANTED STATE AND

00:01:35.008 --> 00:01:35.906
LOCAL AID.

00:01:35.907 --> 00:01:37.534
WE LINKED THOSE TWO TOGETHER,

00:01:37.569 --> 00:01:39.103
BUT NONETHELESS ALTHOUGH WE HAD

00:01:39.137 --> 00:01:40.846
A DEAL ON STATE AND LOCAL, WE

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:42.319
NEVER GOT IT ON LIABILITY.

00:01:42.354 --> 00:01:44.299
AT SOME POINT YOU’VE GOT TO

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:45.964
DECLARE A VICTORY AND COME HOME.

00:01:45.965 --> 00:01:48.268
AND WE WERE JUST -- WE GOT WHAT

00:01:48.269 --> 00:01:50.135
WE COULD, WE GOT THE RELIEF FOR

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:51.609
THE EMPLOYERS, FOR THE

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.001
EMPLOYEES, FOR THE UNEMPLOYED.

00:01:53.003 --> 00:01:53.869
WE COULDN’T GET LIABILITY

00:01:53.903 --> 00:01:54.175
RELIEF.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.865
WE HAVE TO WORK ON THAT NEXT

00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:56.395
CONGRESS.

