00:02:32.606 --> 00:02:34.473
SO CONGRESS, IT’S OOZY TO SHOVEL

00:02:34.507 --> 00:02:36.295
MONEY OUT -- EASY TO SHOVEL

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.095
MONEY OUT, PICK A NUMBER AND SAY

00:02:38.097 --> 00:02:39.495
