00:02:43.028 --> 00:02:44.928
WAY TO TARGET THIS, AND THAT’S

00:02:44.962 --> 00:02:46.628
WHAT DOESN’T HAPPEN OFTEN HERE

00:02:46.662 --> 00:02:47.332
